        "body": "Tweaks type def to remove `as any` casts. Depends/Stacked on https://github.com/h3js/h3/pull/1635.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **TypeScript**\n  * Standardized generic type parameter names across handler, request, validation, streaming, error, routing, and schema APIs for more consistent type declarations.\n  * Updated validated-handler typings to reflect the response type and validated request data more precisely.\n  * Runtime behavior remains unchanged.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
